  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. The following occurred during Q2 2026:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darren Thomas appointed Managing Director;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rebecca Beckham appointed as Vice President &amp;amp; Controller.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;14. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;SILVER RUN ELECTRIC, LLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; and Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 12.8pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 102%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Silver Run Electric, LLC (the Company) was formed on May 19, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2015&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; as a Delaware limited liability company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; is owned by Silver Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Holdings, LLC (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Silver Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Holdings)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 12.8pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 102%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company was formed to develop, own, and operate transmission &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the system operated by the PJM Interconnection, LLC (PJM). On July&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;29, 2015, the PJM Board of Managers announced the selection of the Company&amp;#8217;s proposal for a project in the Regional Transmission Expansion Plan process proposal window from April&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2013 to June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2013 (the Project). The Project is a new substation in Delaware and a new 230 kV transmission line that runs from the new substation in Delaware to the existing Hope Creek substation in Lower Alloways Creek, New Jersey. The transmission line is approximately five miles long, including an approximate three&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;mile submarine crossing of the Delaware River. The substation portion of the Project was completed and placed into commercial operations on April&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;28, 2020&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and the transmission line portion of the Project was completed and placed into commercial operations on May&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;23, 2020.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -22.5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt; of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 12.8pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 102%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company&amp;#8217;s financial statements and accompanying notes were prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (U.S. GAAP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.75pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The primary differences between the Company's FERC financial statements and U.S. GAAP financial statements are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;removal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reported&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;depreciation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;purposes (U.S. GAAP requires that cost of removal be classified as a regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;liability);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.95pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;There is no current liability classification of the current portion of long-term debt; and deferred financing costs are reported separately in the FERC balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;sheet;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.9pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The presentation of regulatory assets and regulatory liabilities in the balance sheet under U.S. GAAP requirements differs from FERC requirements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;d)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The inclusion of income taxes as a component of the FERC financial statements pursuant to the FERC&amp;#8217;s Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances, rather than the exclusion of income taxes pursuant to U.S. GAAP due to the Company&amp;#8217;s treatment as a flow through entity; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;e)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;A portion of Member&amp;#8217;s equity for U.S. GAAP reporting purposes is included in Accumulated Deferred Income Taxes for FERC reporting purposes. However, the Members pay income taxes on their allocated share of the Company&amp;#8217;s income and for purposes herein, those taxes are calculated using the federal corporate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.75pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;These financial statements and notes reflect the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;s evaluation of events occurring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;subsequent to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the accompanying balance sheet dates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;through August 31, 2026, the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; date the Company filed this report with FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.75pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Regulatory Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company has received FERC approval to use a company-specific, forward-looking or projected formula rate framework in setting its transmission rates. These projected rates are updated annually with forecasted information. An annual reconciliation or true-up, which calculates the revenue requirement using actual data, is used to adjust the projected rates in a subsequent year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Formula Rate Items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On April 15, 2026, in FERC Docket No. ER26-2237, the Company submitted an informational filing as required under its formula rate protocols. This informational filing included the Company&amp;#8217;s 2026 projection and the true-up adjustment for the rate year 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On May 22, 2026, in FERC Docket No. ER26-2606, the Company submitted revisions to add an account and depreciation rate inadvertently omitted from the formula rate template submitted in FERC Docket No. ER25-2061. On July 16, 2026, the Commission issued an order accepting the Company&amp;#8217;s revisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On June 30, 2026, the Company published its formula rate annual update, calculating the true-up adjustment for rate year 2025. The calculated over-recovery, including interest, will adjust the projected ATRR for rate year 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Contracts and Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Silver Run Upgrade Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On October 26, 2022, as part of the State of New Jersey&amp;#8217;s Offshore Wind Transmission Competitive Solicitation, the Company was selected by the NJBPU to increase the capacity of its system. The Project was added to the RTEP by the PJM Board of Managers at a meeting on December 5, 2022. To accommodate the planned increase in load due to future renewable projects in New Jersey, the Company planned to add additional submarine cables and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;upgrading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;some equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; at its existing substation (Upgrade Project). The Upgrade Project ha&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; an estimated cost &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in excess of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; $100 million with a required in-service date by 2029. The Company began project execution in 2023 and entered into an engineering and construction agreement in 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On April 22, 2026, the NJBPU board voted to approve a mutual termination agreement between PJM and the state of New Jersey to terminate the previously executed SAA agreement that drove the need for the Silver Run Upgrade Project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Upgrade Project was identified as a cancelled project under this &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;agreement. On June 22, 2026, FERC accepted the mutual termination agreement in FERC Docket No. ER26-2294. As of June 30, 2026, the costs incurred by the Company are presented as Miscellaneous deferred debits while the Company determines cost recovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;inancing Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company did not have any long-term debt issuances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; during the first six months of 2026. The Company made a principal payment of $0.8 million on its term loan for an outstanding balance of $59.6 million as of June 30, 2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Member&amp;#8217;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Profit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, losses and distributions are allocated in accordance with t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;he provisions of the Company&amp;#8217;s limited l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;iability agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; In 2026, total equity distributions from the Company were $3.9 million. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
